=
\frac{\sqrt{3}}
{Z_1+Z_2+Z_f}\] For zero fault impedance, \[I_f(\text{without }Z_f)
=
\frac{\sqrt{3}}
{Z_1+Z_2}\] According to the question, \[I_f(\text{with }Z_f)
=
k\,I_f(\text{without }Z_f)\] Substituting the fault current expressions, \[\frac{\sqrt{3}}
